    {
      "candidateId": "cZKvoer33gkfEXO1VpZtCVL3t6Ub0DZykQrgWqEKdm4",
      "displayText": "「余はあす、魯西亜に向かいて出発すべし。随いて来べきか」",
      "order": 29,
      "sha256": "36236574425541e81a0546f0ddb963c18ff5adfd6fa7dd456a2c1264311f0a0d",
      "sourceAnchor": ".main_text:10971-10997",
      "speechText": "「余はあす、ロシヤに向かいて出発すべし。したがいてくべきか」"
    },
    {
      "candidateId": "hCnpiZ2NlRr_T9AlXWRXHwj8HBEuKdxHLwBdtCQOBy0",
      "displayText": "「いかで命に従わざらむ」",
      "order": 30,
      "sha256": "6c7212877ea1e4fe860687dc5a0b0a8a3877df6bfec69ea63331720a4648e8d4",
      "sourceAnchor": ".main_text:11042-11054",
